Subject: [PATCH] feat: local games library with art lookup, Steam presence and
 LAN discovery

Adds a "Local games" page for programs that aren't on Steam:
- add a program, scan a games folder, import itch.io or Minecraft
- banner, cover, icon, logo and details fetched from the Steam store and
  (with an optional key) SteamGridDB, with a manual picker for bad matches
- Steam-style game page: hero, play bar, About / Notes / LAN / Properties
- friends see "Playing <name>" via new Command::SetLocalPlaying
- per-game play time
- LAN host discovery over UDP, joining by filling in launch options

New crate `localgames`; its std-only modules (id, exe, text, lan) have unit
tests. See docs/local-games.md.

